# From the atelier asset gitattributes, adapted to this repo.
#
# Text checks out exactly as committed, LF, on every machine. Git for Windows
# sets core.autocrlf=true for the whole system, and without this file a
# checkout there turns every text file CRLF: the endOfLine 'lf' of prettier
# then fails every line of every file in the lint gate. CI runs a job on
# Windows (windows-helper). Git finds binary files itself and does not change
# them (text=auto).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets stay binary, also if a file looks like text to git: the demo
# GIF of the docs, the Office and Outlook samples of the read tests, and the
# formats that the conversion commands read or write.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.msg binary
